# A sphere over a ground plane, generated for RepoSphereExplorer's
# fixture set: 16 vertices and 22 faces, with normals, texture
# coordinates and named groups. One plugin owns one sample
# directory, so the material library that would normally sit beside
# this file is left out: a .mtl is text, not a model.

